„­bible_version£KJV¤book§chapter¨sectionsš…¤book§chapter«first_verseªlast_verse¦verses˜„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ=And the LORD spake unto Moses and to Aaron, saying unto them,¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ~Speak unto the children of Israel, saying, These are the beasts which ye shall eat among all the beasts that are on the earth.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÃ¥lines‘‚¤textÙkWhatsoever parteth the hoof, and is clovenfooted, and cheweth the cud, among the beasts, that shall ye eat.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ¼Nevertheless these shall ye not eat of them that chew the cud, or of them that divide the hoof: as the camel, because he cheweth the cud, but divideth not the hoof; he is unclean unto you.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ]And the coney, because he cheweth the cud, but divideth not the hoof; he is unclean unto you.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ\And the hare, because he cheweth the cud, but divideth not the hoof; he is unclean unto you.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙpAnd the swine, though he divide the hoof, and be clovenfooted, yet he cheweth not the cud; he is unclean to you.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ_Of their flesh shall ye not eat, and their carcase shall ye not touch; they are unclean to you.¦layout ªlast_verse…¤book§chapter«first_verse	ªlast_verse¦verses”„¥verse	¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ“These shall ye eat of all that are in the waters: whatsoever hath fins and scales in the waters, in the seas, and in the rivers, them shall ye eat.¦layout ªlast_verse	„¥verse
